1. **🔴 SYNC-01 + SYNC-02 + SYNC-03** → Reescrever `useSyncEngine` com `useRef`, backoff, `beforeunload`.
2. **🔴 SEC-01** → Remover `user_id` do payload do frontend; validar RLS no Supabase.
